message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "SEMBRA Framework: Surrogate models for instability of dielectric elastomer membranes"
abstract: >-
  A surrogate framework for predicting the equilibrium state and
  stability of an inflated circular dielectric elastomer membrane under
  combined mechanical pressure and electrical actuation. Ships two
  Python packages: sembra_vc (voltage-controlled actuation) and
  sembra_cc (charge-controlled actuation). Each package provides a
  trained neural surrogate, Gaussian process envelope models, an
  analytical symbolic core, and an inference wrapper. Companion code to
  the paper by Kumar, Mathur, and DasGupta.
